# 23. FINAL FEEDBACK

The final feedback must include:

## Overall Score

0–100.

Use the existing weighted scoring model unless there is a strong reason to improve it:

```text
Technical Correctness    30%
Depth                    20%
Practical Understanding 20%
Engineering Reasoning    15%
Communication            15%
```

Formula:

```text
Overall =
0.30 * Correctness
+ 0.20 * Depth
+ 0.20 * Practical
+ 0.15 * Reasoning
+ 0.15 * Communication
```

Round to nearest integer.

