# 35. IMPORTANT DISTINCTION

The system must distinguish:

```text
PASSED
FAILED
SKIPPED
MISSING
```

These signals mean different things.

### PASSED

Candidate demonstrated successful completion.

### FAILED

Candidate attempted but did not successfully complete.

### SKIPPED

Candidate did not demonstrate completion.

### MISSING

The dataset contains no record for that curriculum day.

Do not merge these categories.

